flowchart TD
    %% START & ONBOARDING
    Start([Start: User Accesses System]) --> Register[Account Registration & Profile Setup]
    Register --> UploadKYC[Upload Driver's License for KYC]
    UploadKYC --> VerifyKYC[Admin Reviews License Details]
    VerifyKYC --> CheckKYC{License Approved?}

    CheckKYC -- No --> RejectKYC[Notify User & Request Valid License Re-upload]
    RejectKYC --> UploadKYC

    CheckKYC -- Yes --> UnlockAccount[Activate Account & Unlock Booking Access]

    %% VEHICLE SELECTION & BOOKING
    UnlockAccount --> BrowseCars[Browse Fleet & Select Rental Dates]
    BrowseCars --> CheckAvail{Vehicle Available?}

    CheckAvail -- No --> ChangeChoice[Suggest Other Vehicles or Different Dates]
    ChangeChoice --> BrowseCars

    CheckAvail -- Yes --> SelectBooking[Select Insurance Package & Add-on Options]
    SelectBooking --> Payment[Process Payment: GCash, Card, or Cash]
    Payment --> CheckPay{Payment Confirmed?}

    CheckPay -- No --> RetryPay[Payment Failed: Prompt User to Retry]
    RetryPay --> Payment

    %% CONFIRMATION & DISPATCH
    CheckPay -- Yes --> ConfirmBook[Lock Vehicle in Fleet Calendar & Dispatch Booking Confirmation]
    ConfirmBook --> Handover[Initial Vehicle Inspection & Key Handover]
    Handover --> ActiveRental[Active Trip: Live GPS Tracking & Automated Reminders]

    %% ACTIVE TRIP & EXTENSIONS
    ActiveRental --> ExtRequest{Extension Requested?}

    ExtRequest -- Yes --> CheckExt{Vehicle Available for Extension?}
    CheckExt -- Yes --> PayExt[Settle Extension Fee & Update Fleet Calendar]
    PayExt --> ActiveRental
    CheckExt -- No --> DenyExt[Decline Extension & Maintain Return Schedule]
    DenyExt --> ReturnVehicle

    ExtRequest -- No --> ReturnVehicle[Return Vehicle at Designated Location]

    %% RETURN, PENALTY & CLOSING
    ReturnVehicle --> ReturnInspect[Admin Return Inspection: Fuel Level, Odometer & Condition]
    ReturnInspect --> CheckPenalty{Late Return or Penalties Incurred?}

    CheckPenalty -- Yes --> ApplyPenalty[System Calculates Late Penalty & Settles Balance]
    ApplyPenalty --> FinalizeTrip

    CheckPenalty -- No --> FinalizeTrip[Complete Booking & Submit Customer Rating/Review]

    FinalizeTrip --> SystemLog[Update Vehicle Status to Available & Record Audit Logs]
    SystemLog --> End([End: Vehicle Ready for Next Booking])
